Packaged from the official GitHub release asset
(ProtonPlus-0.6.8-anylinux-x86_64.AppImage), not built from source. The
"anylinux" AppImage bundles a sharun runtime with a DwarFS payload holding the
whole app plus its GTK4/libadwaita/SDL3 libraries; the recipe self-extracts it
at install time (--appimage-extract, no /dev/fuse needed) into
lib/protonplus, and bin/protonplus is a tiny wrapper that exports APPDIR and
execs the extracted AppRun. The desktop entry and icon are copied out of the
AppDir into share/applications + share/pixmaps so the menu entry is indexed.

Runtime is self-contained; the manager still downloads Proton/GE-Proton builds
on demand (network required once per install).